{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600360/extras/500bc58ab7b02fedfb32a18d9de56375.avif?t=1771572363\" width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Rose Academy</strong> is a detective visual novel about a young special agent sent to an elite girls' school to investigate the mysterious death of one of its top students. As you uncover the dark secrets hidden behind the academy\u2019s flawless facade, you'll be drawn into a world of intrigue, temptation, and romance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>A detective story with a touch of romance</strong>: Investigate the crime, flirt with suspects, and make choices\u2014each one may bring you closer to the truth or lead you astray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Expansive narrative</strong>: With over 70,000 words and 6\u20138 hours of gameplay, experience a story full of tension, emotion, and unexpected twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Interactive journal</strong>: All collected clues, observations, and suspect information are automatically recorded in a handy journal\u2014your main investigation tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Meaningful dialogue choices</strong>: Your words matter. Decide who to question, who to trust, and how to approach each lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: A rich, atmospheric score enhances the story\u2019s most emotional and suspenseful moments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600360?t=1771572363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600360/c26bc6719b1bf1e1caa29e2846e04d616cb469f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771572363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600360/9a480b58e8f9e2ed6bc3fe10b2d19181